ED.", "timestamp_created": 1706739127, "timestamp_updated": 1706739127, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157281380", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975811462", "personaname": "warriorwon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/warriorwon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 3937, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3484, "last_played": 1708056563, "avatar": "da152c28eaecb039e347795381c33155c772d5df"}, "language": "english", "review": "A bit tough on insane setting, overall a good FPS.  Haven't tried with a group, but solo is fine.", "timestamp_created": 1706732046, "timestamp_updated": 1706732046, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157244207", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971585537", "personaname": "Dempsey Brainard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xynox775/", "num_games_owned": 77, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 213, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 213, "last_played": 1706689880, "avatar": "4ab3db0761bdfb0b02c32de00e0924e1270cf81a"}, "language": "english", "review": "prichard blew the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ - jemprey magnolia", "timestamp_created": 1706689933, "timestamp_updated": 1706689933, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157228570", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066677871", "personaname": "The Vapis Bull", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066677871/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 5724, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4368, "last_played": 1723559981, "avatar": "522b9ce97c10f113002a883cfd718e476127da17"}, "language": "english", "review": "8/10\nThis game is a great coop shooter! \n\nThe story and ambiance fit the setting quite well, the Xenos make for a great enemy for this kind of game play loop. I would liken the game play to something of a hybrid of Vermintide 2 and Deep Rock Galactic. \nYou play through story missions or several other non-story missions that involve moving from point to point fighting roving Xenos, these points often being a spot where you will fight a constant wave of aliens including larger ones or specialist ones. \n\nThe six different playable classes all need to be leveled up to unlock their full potential. I wouldn't recommend this game for a single player one time play through as the campaign is short and you would barely scratch the surface on one play through. \n\nIf you're  a fan of horde shooters this one is definitely worth it, tho you may want to wait for a sale.", "timestamp_created": 1706666379, "timestamp_updated": 1707067288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}